/* ============================================
   KEY CONCEPTS
   ============================================ */

/* 1. Color System:
   - Uses HSL format for themeability
   - Pattern: {color}-{shade} (ultra-light to ultra-dark)
   - Pattern: {color}-trans-{10-90} for transparency
   - Contextual colors adapt to background (bg-ultra-light-text, etc.)

2. Typography:
   - Fluid responsive sizing with clamp()
   - Separate heading and text font families
   - Line heights use calc() with ex units

3. Spacing:
   - Two scales: space-* (small) and section-space-* (large)
   - All values are fluid/responsive
   - Contextual gaps: content-gap, container-gap, grid-gap

4. Layout:
   - Content-based width system (--content-width)
   - Percentage widths based on content-width
   - Auto-grids for responsive columns
   - Grid templates for fixed layouts

5. Utility Classes:
   - BEM-like naming: .bg--{color}-{modifier}
   - Consistent pattern across all utilities
   - CSS custom properties enable easy theming

6. Components:
   - Use CSS custom properties for customization
   - Variants via modifiers: .card--light, .card--dark
   - Inline styles can override via CSS variables

7. Smart Spacing:
   - .smart-spacing class provides automatic spacing
   - Context-aware spacing between elements
   - Different spacing for headings vs paragraphs

8. Responsive:
   - Fluid typography and spacing
   - Breakpoint-based adjustments for header-height, etc.
   - Mobile-first approach
*/

